{
    "name": "玻璃加工",
    "category": "tfg:craftsmanship",
    "icon": "tfc:blowpipe_with_glass",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "index",
            "text": "$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#intro)玻璃配料$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#lime_and_potash)石灰與鉀鹼$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#tools)玻璃加工工具$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#blowpipe)吹管$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#paddle)整型板$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#jacks)夾鉗$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#saw)寶石鋸$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#glassworking_steps)玻璃加工步驟$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#table_pour)桌面澆注$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#basin_pour)盆槽澆注$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#coloring)玻璃上色$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#dyes)染料清單$()"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "intro",
            "title": "簡介",
            "text": "玻璃工藝是將沙子變成玻璃的藝術。首先，决定製作哪種$(thing)玻璃原料$()：$(br)$(br) 1、$(thing)二氧化硅玻璃$()：由白沙製作。$(br) 2、$(thing)赤鐵礦玻璃$()：由黄沙、紅沙或粉紅沙製作。$(br) 3、$(thing)橄欖岩玻璃$()：由綠沙或棕沙製作。$(br) 4、$(thing)火山岩玻璃$()：由黑沙製作。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "tfc:crafting/silica_glass_batch",
            "text": "接著可以用上述其中一種顏色的沙子，加上$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#lime_and_potash)石灰$()和一種$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#lime_and_potash)鉀鹼$()合成玻璃配料。$(br)記住，用錘子敲碎礫石可以取得不同種類的沙子。",
            "title": "矽玻璃配料"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:smelting",
            "anchor": "lime_and_potash",
            "title": "石灰與鉀鹼",
            "recipe": "tfg:smelting/dried_seaweed_to_soda",
            "text": "$(item)蘇打灰$()或$(item)硝石$()可以作為$(thing)鉀鹼$()的來源。蘇打灰是加熱$(thing)乾海藻$()或$(thing)海帶$()製成的粉末。$(br2)$(item)石灰$()是加熱$(item)助熔劑$()製成的。",
            "recipe2": "tfg:smelting/lime"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "tools",
            "text": "玻璃加工從一份玻璃配料開始，接著完成一系列步驟。這些步驟可能需要特定的工具：$(br)$(li)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#blowpipe)吹管$()，用來$(thing)吹製$()和$(thing)拉伸$()。$(li)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#paddle)整型板$()，用來$(thing)壓平$()。$(li)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#jacks)夾鉗$()，用來$(thing)夾捏$()。$(li)$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#saw)寶石鋸$()，用來$(thing)鋸切$()。$(li)以及$(l:agriculture/weaving)羊毛布$()，用來$(thing)滾壓$()。",
            "title": "職人工具"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "anchor": "blowpipe",
            "title": "吹管",
            "item": "tfc:ceramic/unfired_blowpipe,tfc:ceramic_blowpipe,tfc:blowpipe",
            "text": "最重要的工具是$(thing)吹管$()。可以用黏土$(thing)塑形$()出$(item)未燒製的陶瓷吹管$()，再燒製成$(thing)陶瓷吹管$()。$(br)不過，陶瓷吹管很脆弱，使用時有機率破損。用$(thing)黃銅棒$()在鐵砧上$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#working)鍛造$()可以做出不會損壞的$(item)吹管$()。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "anchor": "paddle",
            "title": "整型板",
            "recipe": "tfc:crafting/paddle",
            "text": "$(thing)整型板$()由木材加工製成，用來$(thing)壓平$()玻璃。"
        },
        {
            "type": "tfg:welding_recipe",
            "anchor": "jacks",
            "title": "夾鉗",
            "recipe": "tfc:welding/jacks",
            "text": "$(thing)夾捏$()操作可以用$(thing)夾鉗$()完成，夾鉗是將黃銅棒和黃銅板$(l:craftsmanship/anvils#welding)焊接$()製成的。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "anchor": "saw",
            "title": "寶石鋸",
            "recipe": "tfc:crafting/gem_saw",
            "text": "$(thing)鋸切$()操作可以用$(item)寶石鋸$()完成。寶石鋸也用來破壞$(item)玻璃方塊$()和$(item)玻璃片$()以取得它們。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "glassworking_steps",
            "text": "首先，吹管上的玻璃必須加熱到至少$(4)$(bold)暗紅色$()。然後，將吹管拿在$(thing)副手$()，按住$(item)$(k:key.use)$()執行每個步驟$()。$(br)按下$(item)$(k:key.swapOffhand)$()可以將高溫的吹管拿到副手。$(br2)$(bold)吹製$()$(br)面向正前方使用$(thing)吹管$()。$(br2)$(bold)拉伸$()$(br)面向正下方使用$(thing)吹管$()。",
            "title": "如何加工玻璃"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "$(bold)壓平$()$(br)主手拿著$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#paddle)整型板$()時使用$(thing)吹管$()。$(br2)$(bold)夾捏$()$(br)主手拿著$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#jacks)夾鉗$()時使用$(thing)吹管$()。$(br2)$(bold)鋸切$()$(br)主手拿著$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#saw)寶石鋸$()時使用$(thing)吹管$()。$(br2)$(bold)滾壓$()$(br)主手拿著$(l:agriculture/weaving)羊毛布$()時使用$(thing)吹管$()。"
        },
        {
