                "tfg:textures/gui/field_guide/glassworking/glass_2.png",
                "tfg:textures/gui/field_guide/glassworking/glass_3.png"
            ],
            "text": "$(bold)教學幻燈片：$()逐步製作綠色染色玻璃。",
            "border": true
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "$(thing)玻璃片$()是用$(thing)桌面澆注$()製成的。在連續的區域中放置最多十六個$(thing)高嶺土方塊$()或$(thing)鍍黃銅方塊$()即可做成澆注台。$(br2) 1. 將$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking)玻璃配料$()加到$(thing)吹管$()上。$(br) 2. 將吹管加熱到$(4)$(bold)暗紅色$()。$(br) 3. $()手持$(thing)吹管$()對澆注台頂部按下$(item)$(k:key.use)$()。$(br) 4. 最後，手持$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#paddle)整型板$()按下$(item)$(k:key.use)$()將玻璃壓平。",
            "title": "桌面澆注",
            "anchor": "table_pour"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "text": "玻璃冷卻後，可以用$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#saw)寶石鋸$()破壞來取得。",
            "border": true,
            "multiblock": {
                "mapping": {
                    "0": "#tfc:glass_pouring_table",
                    "C": "#tfc:glass_pouring_table"
                },
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "CCCC",
                        "CCC0",
                        "CCCC",
                        "CCCC"
                    ]
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "$(thing)玻璃方塊$()是用$(thing)盆槽澆注$()製成的。用$(thing)高嶺土方塊$()或$(thing)鍍黃銅方塊$()包圍一格空氣方塊除了頂部以外的所有面，即可做成盆槽。$(br2) 1. 將$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking)玻璃配料$()加到$(thing)吹管$()上。$(br) 2. 將吹管加熱到$(4)$(bold)暗紅色$()。$(br) 3. 手持$(thing)吹管$()對盆槽頂部按下$(item)$(k:key.use)$()。",
            "title": "盆槽澆注",
            "anchor": "basin_pour"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "text": "玻璃冷卻後，可以用$(l:craftsmanship/glassworking#saw)寶石鋸$()破壞來取得。",
            "border": true,
